      "description": "We're Hiring | VLA Engineer / Intern Company: Intuitive Research & Development Pvt. Ltd. (IRDPL) Location: Pune, Maharashtra We are looking for talented engineers and fresh graduates interested in developing Vision-Language-Action (VLA) models for intelligent robotic systems and ...",
      "raw_description": "We're Hiring | VLA Engineer / Intern Company: Intuitive Research & Development Pvt. Ltd. (IRDPL) Location: Pune, Maharashtra We are looking for talented engineers and fresh graduates interested in developing Vision-Language-Action (VLA) models for intelligent robotic systems and Physical AI. The role focuses on core VLA model research, architecture development, multimodal learning, and connecting AI intelligence with real-world robotic actions. Key Responsibilities Research and develop Vision-Language-Action (VLA) architectures. Integrate vision, language, and robotic action models. Develop multimodal models for visual perception and scene understanding. Translate natural-language instructions into robotic actions. Explore end-to-end learning for robotic manipulation and navigation. Work on imitation learning and reinforcement learning. Prepare and process robotic datasets, demonstrations, and action trajectories. Train, fine-tune, evaluate, and optimize VLA models. Explore real-time AI inference for robotic applications. Research Physical AI and embodied intelligence. Required Technical Skills Strong Python programming skills. Good understanding of Machine Learning and Deep Learning. Knowledge of Transformer architecture and Attention Mechanisms. Understanding of Computer Vision and Vision-Language Models. Familiarity with PyTorch and Hugging Face. Understanding of multimodal learning and neural network architectures. Basic knowledge of robotics, coordinate systems, and kinematics. Interest in core model training and architecture development. Good to Have Familiarity with OpenVLA, RT-2, π0, Octo, or similar foundation models. Knowledge of Vision Transformers (ViT) and CLIP. Experience with Reinforcement Learning and Imitation Learning. Familiarity with ROS 2 and robotic simulation. Knowledge of NVIDIA Isaac Sim and GPU computing. Experience with robotic datasets and simulation-to-real transfer. Eligibility B.E./B.Tech/M.Tech students, fresh graduates, or experienced candidates in AI/ML, Computer Science, Robotics, or related disciplines. Strong fundamentals in AI/ML and deep learning. Academic projects, research work, or personal implementations in AI/ML are preferred. Strong analytical, mathematical, and problem-solving skills. What You'll Work On Core VLA model research and development. Vision-language understanding for robotic systems. Learning-based robotic action generation. Physical AI and embodied intelligence. Training intelligent models using robotic interaction data. Connecting AI models with real-world robotic hardware. We are looking for candidates with strong technical fundamentals, research curiosity, and a genuine interest in building the next generation of intelligent robotic systems. Interested candidates can share their updated resumes, GitHub profiles, and AI/ML project details. #Hiring #VLA #VisionLanguageAction #AIEngineer #AIIntern #PhysicalAI #Robotics #DeepLearning #MachineLearning #EmbodiedAI #PuneJobs",
