      "description": "MACHINE LEARNING INTERN Company: Devryxa Location: Remote Employment Type: Full-Time Compensation: Performance-Based, up to ₹25,000/- ABOUT THE COMPANY Devryxa provides professionals with opportunities to develop practical expertise in machine learning and artificial intelligence...",
      "raw_description": "MACHINE LEARNING INTERN Company: Devryxa Location: Remote Employment Type: Full-Time Compensation: Performance-Based, up to ₹25,000/- ABOUT THE COMPANY Devryxa provides professionals with opportunities to develop practical expertise in machine learning and artificial intelligence technologies. The organization focuses on building real-world technical and analytical capabilities through hands-on projects, professional guidance, and industry-oriented experiences. ABOUT THE ROLE Devryxa is looking for a motivated and analytical MACHINE LEARNING INTERN to join its team. In this role, you will contribute to developing, training, testing, and evaluating machine learning models for practical business applications. You will work with datasets, apply machine learning algorithms, perform feature engineering, evaluate model performance, and develop data-driven solutions to real-world problems. KEY RESPONSIBILITIES Collect, clean, and preprocess datasets for machine learning projects. Perform exploratory data analysis (EDA) to understand datasets and identify patterns. Identify and select relevant features for machine learning models. Develop, train, and test machine learning models. Evaluate model performance using appropriate metrics and techniques. Optimize models to improve accuracy, efficiency, and overall performance. Create visualizations to communicate analytical findings and model results. Document experiments, methodologies, and technical findings. Research emerging machine learning techniques, algorithms, and industry practices. Collaborate with team members on machine learning and AI-based projects. Assist in developing machine learning solutions for real-world applications. ELIGIBILITY Bachelor's degree or currently pursuing a degree in Computer Science, Data Science, Artificial Intelligence, Statistics, Mathematics, or a related field. Strong interest in machine learning and artificial intelligence. Understanding of fundamental machine learning concepts and algorithms. Ability to work with datasets and solve analytical problems. Willingness to learn new technologies and contribute to practical machine learning projects. REQUIRED SKILLS Basic to intermediate knowledge of Python programming. Understanding of statistics and data analysis concepts. Familiarity with Pandas, NumPy, and Scikit-learn. Basic understanding of supervised and unsupervised learning algorithms. Knowledge of data preprocessing and feature engineering. Understanding of machine learning model evaluation techniques. Strong analytical and problem-solving skills. Good communication, research, and teamwork skills. PERKS & BENEFITS Performance-based compensation up to ₹25,000/-. Opportunity to work on real-world machine learning and AI projects. Professional guidance and industry exposure. Recognition for outstanding performance. Opportunity to develop practical technical and analytical skills. EQUAL OPPORTUNITY STATEMENT Devryxa is an equal opportunity organization committed to providing an inclusive and supportive work environment. We welcome applicants from diverse backgrounds and encourage individuals with a passion for machine learning, artificial intelligence, continuous learning, and professional growth to apply.",
