      "description": "About the role We’re looking for a resourceful generalist who can take on a wide range of projects and use AI to get things done faster and better. You’ll work across research, operations, content, automation and problem-solving, depending on what the business needs. This role is...",
      "raw_description": "About the role We’re looking for a resourceful generalist who can take on a wide range of projects and use AI to get things done faster and better. You’ll work across research, operations, content, automation and problem-solving, depending on what the business needs. This role is a good fit for someone who is curious, organised and comfortable turning a rough idea into a finished result. You don’t need to be an expert in every area, but you should be quick to learn and confident using AI tools in your daily work. What you’ll do Use AI tools to research topics, analyse information and produce clear, useful outputs. Create and improve content, presentations, reports, documents and other business materials. Identify repetitive tasks and build practical automations to save time. Support projects across teams, from planning and coordination through to execution. Turn broad requests into actionable plans, manage priorities and follow through. Review AI-generated work for accuracy, quality, tone and relevance. Explore new AI tools and recommend ways to use them in the business. Document processes and share useful workflows with the team. What we’re looking for Strong hands-on experience with AI tools such as ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini or similar platforms. Ability to write effective prompts and refine outputs for different tasks. Experience using AI for more than content generation—for example, research, analysis, workflows or automation. Excellent written communication and attention to detail. Strong organisational skills and the ability to manage multiple projects. Good judgment: you know when to verify information, ask questions and involve others. A proactive, adaptable approach and a willingness to learn new tools quickly. Nice to have Experience with automation tools such as Zapier, Make or n8n. Familiarity with spreadsheets, dashboards and basic data analysis. Experience with design, video editing, marketing, operations or project management. Basic coding or experience building tools with AI-assisted development. Experience working in a startup or other fast-moving environment. What success looks like In your first few months, you’ll have taken ownership of recurring tasks, delivered projects with minimal supervision and introduced AI workflows that make the team more effective.",
