      "description": "🚀 We're Hiring | Business Analyst (Fresher) Immediate joiners Preffered Company: Multiplier AI Limited Experience: 0–6 Months (Freshers Welcome) No of Positions - 3 Employment Type: Full-Time Location: Noida, Uttar Pradesh | Work From Office About Multiplier AI Limited Multiplier...",
      "raw_description": "🚀 We're Hiring | Business Analyst (Fresher) Immediate joiners Preffered Company: Multiplier AI Limited Experience: 0–6 Months (Freshers Welcome) No of Positions - 3 Employment Type: Full-Time Location: Noida, Uttar Pradesh | Work From Office About Multiplier AI Limited Multiplier AI Limited is an AI-first healthcare and technology company delivering AI-powered solutions, advanced analytics, automation, and digital transformation services. We are looking for a motivated and detail-oriented Business Analyst to join our team. The role will involve a combination of business analysis, client coordination, sales and CRM coordination, and technical team collaboration. Approximately 70% of the role will focus on non-IT business coordination and client-facing activities , while the remaining responsibilities will involve technical business analysis and documentation. Key Responsibilities Business, Sales & Client Coordination (70%) Coordinate with Sales, CRM, Business Development, and Technical teams to ensure smooth communication and workflow. Make calls to clients and prospects for initial discussions, follow-ups, requirement gathering, and coordination. Communicate with clients to understand their business needs, queries, and project requirements. Coordinate between clients and internal teams to ensure timely updates, follow-ups, and task completion. Support the sales team with lead tracking, CRM updates, client records, meeting schedules, and follow-up activities. Maintain client databases, coordination trackers, call records, and daily activity reports. Follow up on pending client requirements, proposals, meetings, and internal deliverables. Assist in preparing client presentations, business proposals, reports, and coordination documents. Business Analysis & Technical Coordination (30%) Gather and understand business requirements from clients and internal teams. Prepare BRDs, FRDs, SRS documents, user stories, and functional documentation. Analyze business processes and identify areas for improvement. Coordinate with developers, QA, UI/UX, and project management teams. Create workflow diagrams, process flows, and project reports. Participate in requirement discussions, project meetings, and testing activities. Support product analysis and AI-based software development projects. Required Skills & Qualifications Bachelor's degree in BCA, MCA, B.Tech, B.Sc. IT, or a related field. Freshers with 0–6 months of experience are encouraged to apply. Basic understanding of SDLC and Agile methodologies. Knowledge of MS Excel, Word, and PowerPoint. Basic understanding of software applications and business documentation. Familiarity with CRM tools, Jira, SQL, Figma, or flowchart tools is an added advantage. Strong verbal and written communication skills. Comfortable making client calls, handling follow-ups, and coordinating with different teams. Good interpersonal, analytical, and problem-solving skills. Willingness to learn new technologies and AI-based solutions. What We're Looking For Strong communication and client-handling abilities. Confidence in making calls and conducting professional follow-ups. Interest in sales coordination, CRM management, and business operations. Ability to coordinate effectively with multiple internal teams. Analytical and logical thinking. Attention to detail and good documentation skills. Quick learning ability, adaptability, and a proactive approach. Interest in business processes and technology. 📩 How to Apply Interested candidates can share their updated CV. Start your career with Multiplier AI Limited and grow in the exciting fields of Business Analysis, Client Coordination, Sales Operations, and Artificial Intelligence! #Hiring #BusinessAnalyst #FresherJobs #EntryLevelJobs #NoidaJobs #ClientCoordination #SalesCoordination #CRM #BusinessOperations #AIJobs #MultiplierAI",
